{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Pick A Side - Dinosaurs or Survivors</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dinosaurs</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survivors</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-Person</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetrical 2v6 Multiplayer</strong><br>Two dinosaurs against six survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Maps</strong><br>Every game features a new map layout with randomised Objectives locations and hiding spots. No two matches play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Player-Driven Horror</strong><br>No scripted scares. Every moment is shaped by real players \u2014 their choices, their fears, and their instincts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Photosensitivity Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing lights and visual effects that may trigger seizures for players with photosensitive epilepsy. Discontinue if you experience dizziness or discomfort. Play in a well-lit room and take regular breaks.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050310?t=1764269933","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050310/45cc3fbf8c5bc2b281ae29d3c5bf195cb2739b57/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764269933","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050310/40071b5a6659f23405fa7dabb90db4275192f449/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764269933","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste